      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "URBAN VIVI (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 6 lengths at Richmond in a handy 29.96 beating See No Grief. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with three wins from six starts. Hard to go past. OPAWA GABBY (7) is worth forgiving for her last effort when fourth (30.68) at this track over 520m. Form at this distance is sound. Expected to give a good account. TURBO MOUSE (2) is a progressive type who recorded her 8th career win last time out (22.60) at Maitland. Expecting another bold showing. ANGELIC ANGEL (3) finished in the placings last start and deserves some thought.",
